  "interpretation": "Pointwise coordinate algebra over Lean.Grind.Field with optional standard linear-order/ordered-ring laws. fieldData and rational_field_bridge connect the existing ordinary semantics without changing its laws. No AES conclusion is an assumed structure field. grind builds kernel-checked proof terms. The positive-height carrier is an algebraic chart, not a smooth Riemannian manifold.",
